        {"zh": "那点气也算诱饵", "en": "That ki is bait, then?"},
        {"zh": "我靠近一点看看", "en": "I lean in to have a look."},
        {"zh": "先别收回去", "en": "Do not put it away yet."},
        {"zh": "我闻到了活气", "en": "I smell living ki."},
        {"zh": "这点东西也想引我", "en": "You think that can lure me?"},
        {"zh": "我拿过来尝一口", "en": "I will take it and taste it."}
      ]
    },
    "collide": {
