        {"zh": "别碰我的肩膀", "en": "Do not touch my shoulder."},
        {"zh": "我轻轻一推你就退", "en": "One light push and you go back."},
        {"zh": "这样撞是没用的", "en": "Bumping me will not work."},
        {"zh": "你差点弄坏这具身体", "en": "You nearly damaged this body."},
        {"zh": "退一步再说话", "en": "Take a step back before you speak."}
